DECLARE `s 812 appeal court` IS ONE OF
    `s 812(1)(a) the Superior Court of Justice sitting in the region, district or county or group of counties where the adjudication was made`
    `s 812(1)(b) the Superior Court`
    `s 812(1)(c) the Supreme Court`
    `s 812(1)(d) the Court of Queen's Bench`
    `s 812(1)(h) a judge of the Supreme Court`
    `s 812(1)(i) a judge of the Nunavut Court of Justice`
    `s 812(2) a judge of the Court of Appeal of Nunavut`

@ref Criminal Code s 812(1) (src:17119-17120)
GIVEN place IS A `s 812(1) province or territory`
GIVETH A `s 812 appeal court`
`s 812(1) the appeal court for sections 813 to 828` MEANS
