@ref Criminal Code s 816(1.1) (src:17159-17160)
-- "Immediately" is encoded as no days at all: the keeper must release within 0 days of the compliance. The text names no other consequence.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 816 action`
`s 816(1.1) the custodian is to release the appellant` MEANS
    PARTY `the keeper of a prison`
    MUST `s 816(1.1) release the appellant`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BECAUSE "the person having the custody of the appellant did not release the appellant immediately"

