    MUST `s 819(1) apply to the appeal court to fix a date for the hearing of the appeal`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE `s 819(2) the appeal court is to fix a date for the hearing`
    LEST BREACH BECAUSE "the person having the custody of the appellant did not apply forthwith on the expiration of the thirty days"

