@ref Criminal Code s 821(1) (src:17188-17189)
-- Fork F-821-1: "before the time when the appeal is to be heard" is read at the level of the day: the material is in time if it is transmitted on a day before the hearing day, or by the further day the appeal court directs.
GIVEN `the day on which the material is transmitted` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the appeal is to be heard` IS A DATE
      `the appeal court has directed a further time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the further day directed by the appeal court` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
